{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-110","published":"2026-08-26T17:38:47Z","modified":"2026-08-26T22:41:45.947191739Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-18260","DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-091"],"details":"This module enables you to disable access to the `/user/login` form unless a secret key is provided.\n\nThe module does not sufficiently restrict repeated attempts to guess that key, allowing brute-force attacks against the access-control mechanism.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal/disable_login","ecosystem":"Packagist:https://packages.drupal.org/8","purl":"pkg:composer/drupal/disable_login?repository_url=https:%2F%2Fpackages.drupal.org%2F8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.1.4"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":"<1.1.4"}}],"database_specific":{"affected_versions":"<1.1.4","patched":true,"source":"https://github.com/DrupalSecurityTeam/drupal-advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/disable_login/DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-110.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-110"}],"credits":[{"name":"Pierre Rudloff (prudloff)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/prudloff"]}]}